Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的一定要杀了你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fuckin' kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这他妈的混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fuckin' bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.85,0:00:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这婊子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的一定要杀了你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fuckin' kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.94,0:02:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.51,0:05:00.01,Title,0,0,0,0,,《电锯惊魂3》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意侧边！ 左边安全？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure the flank! Left side clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边安全！ 行动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left side's clear. Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁去把凯莉找来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone call Kerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话是11：45打来的 一个女的听到了爆炸声\N{\fnArial\fs30}The call came in at 11:45. The woman heard an explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,最先到现场的是消防队\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire department was the first on the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.85,0:05:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是他吗？ - 在你进去之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it him? - Before you go in there…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克 是不是他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric. Is it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.63,0:05:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在还确定不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是马修斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not Detective Matthews.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.85,0:06:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害者被铁链穿透 并绑在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The victim was held in place by these chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 特洛伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Troy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和你做个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.53,0:07:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏将会在一个不大的地方里进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}This game will take place in a room not much bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方比起你大半 生都待的地方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the room you've spent most of your life in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱的牢房 要小一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A prison cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.47,0:07:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管老天赋予你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite all of the advantages and privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.01,0:07:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少优势和特权\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you were given at birth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是屡教不悔 一次次的被关进监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have returned to prison again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许拿铁链这么穿着你 比让你自由还舒服吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More comfortable in chains than you are in freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我们来看看 一旦你挣脱铁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight we will see how far you are willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能走多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}to break those chains once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.73,0:07:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是生是死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live or die, Troy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.33,0:07:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:08:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他所要做的就是挣脱掉铁链…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he had to do was release himself from each of the chains…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,并在炸弹爆炸之前走出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}walk out the door before it went off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他所要做的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he had to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,操！操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真有种感觉 感觉马修斯也出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really had this feeling it was going to be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:10:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉 埃里克的案子是一 件失踪案而不是谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kerry, Eric is a missing persons case, not a homicide case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总能做恶梦看见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been having nightmares where I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总原谅不了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never going to be able to forgive myself for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这总是谁的错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always somebody's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那人不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That somebody isn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个罪人还在逍遥法外\N{\fnArial\fs30}That someone is still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把你所有的怒气都用在找到他们 并收拾他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put all your anger into finding them and putting them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.77,0:10:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I don't understand is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,“竖锯”是怎么做到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how the hell could Jigsaw do all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上次看着他的时候 他不是已经快不行了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was damn near on his deathbed the last time we saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.11,0:10:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太肯定是他干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少 这看起来不像是他的手法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far this doesn't follow any of his patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦…你们是怎么进来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… how'd you get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们弄断了门 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We cut the door down. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有人听到了爆炸声并打了电话给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because somebody heard an explosion and called us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.59,0:10:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你们为什么要把门弄断？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why did you have to cut the door down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,门给焊死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was welded shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:10:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的卡车也撞不进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody truck couldn't get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:10:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏的目的是在炸弹爆炸前离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the aim of Jigsaw's game was to get out before the bomb went off,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么还要把门焊死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}then why was the door welded shut?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.07,0:11:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人想出去都出不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy couldn't get out if he wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会相信的 那盘录像带安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't believe this. We got the tape out clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 特洛伊 我想玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Troy. I wanna play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是死是活 特洛伊 你自己定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live or die, Troy. Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Kerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,至今 你的大部分生命都在和死人打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up until now you have spent your life among the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.63,0:14:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼凑着他们生前的最后一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}piecing together their final moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你擅长这个 因为你喜欢死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are good at this because you, like them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说 你也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}are also dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,和活人相比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You identify more with a cold corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你更像具冰冷的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}than you do with a living human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 你想加入你真正的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you want to join your true family,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.42,0:14:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的 你唯一的家庭 死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}indeed, your only family, in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所穿的装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}The device you are wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧紧钩住了你的胸腔\N{\fnArial\fs30}is hooked into your ribcage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且 在这段录像播完后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the time this tape is finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将有一分钟的时间去找出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will have one minute to find a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一分钟结束后 你应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the end of that minute, you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.34,0:15:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,比任何人都清楚 会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}better than anyone what happens then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有一把小小的钥匙 可以打开这器具 凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a simple key that will unlock the harness, Kerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.74,0:15:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就在你面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is right in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.41,0:15:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所要做的就是把手伸进去 并把它拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is reach in and take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是要快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的酸剂会在几秒内把钥匙溶解\N{\fnArial\fs30}The acid will dissolve the key in a matter of seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己选择吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.49,0:16:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我九点就得到医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta be at the hospital by 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是星期二 我以为你十一点上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Tuesday. I thought you started at 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.40,0:17:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不错 但他们最后通知我调班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, they change things on me last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 那你就别理它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you better head off, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不打算洗个澡了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna take a shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:18:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 我到医院里面去洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. I'm just gonna take a shower at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.65,0:18:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能… 好好谈个五分钟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just… talk for five minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.49,0:18:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就这么花个 五秒钟看着对方怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we just make eye contact for five seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.46,0:18:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 只是…所有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Just… everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.51,0:18:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想要我怎么样 克里斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you want from me, Chris?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,离婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}A divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.22,0:18:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,急诊\N{\fnArial\fs30}MPA.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car skidded into oncoming traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,血压？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pressure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.93,0:18:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,８０完毕 心率仪准备完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}80 over, palp. Pulse is thready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗？1 2 3\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready? 1, 2, 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莲恩医生在哪？ - 呼叫莲恩医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Lynn? - Page Dr. Denlon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,广播通知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set up an art-line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩·戴伦医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Lynn Denlon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.07,0:18:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请速至外伤科报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}please report to trauma immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩·戴伦医生 请速至外伤科报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Lynn Denlon, please report to trauma immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lynn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.21,0:19:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查这个 镇痛剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out. Hermaphony.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.11,0:19:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,血压下降到70 他要休克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pressure down to 70. He's going into shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备手术室 我们要进行开胸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get an OR ready. We gotta crack his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.39,0:19:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有反刍血块？ ５００cc左右？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we get a bolus? 500 wide open?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.09,0:19:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 右侧没有气胸 - 然后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No air entry on the right side. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,插入气管就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get a chest tube in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得马上把他送到手术室去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get him to OR now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的指数在下降 体温过低\N{\fnArial\fs30}His stats are dropping. He's gonna code.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.21,0:19:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doin' it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.65,0:19:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给他吸氧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting a rush of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,指数回升 血压回升至80\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stats are improving. Pressure back to 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,血压正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pressure normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你有什么不顺心的事 到楼上找心理医生说去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you got something on your mind, go upstairs to psych.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把情绪带到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't bring it in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.45,0:20:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在争分夺秒 莲恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have any seconds to spare, Lynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是你必须得被人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman standing in front of me had to be dragged.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,从更衣室给拽出来 才愿意把胸管插给外伤病人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the locker room to put a chest tube in a trauma patient?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩·戴伦 应该是第一个在场的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lynn Denlon should have been the first one there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lynn!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真见鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:20:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被锁在里面了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm locked in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.90,0:22:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.78,0:22:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？ 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.18,0:22:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能老实点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna behave?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.83,0:23:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.30,0:23:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？ 这是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place? What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.05,0:23:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是…什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is… this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.82,0:23:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？ 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.47,0:23:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 莲恩·戴伦医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dr. Denlon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.13,0:23:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能不记得我了 但我可是清清楚楚地记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may not remember me, but I most certainly remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.97,0:23:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经是你们医院的一位病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a guest at your hospital once.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.75,0:24:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.99,0:24:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.25,0:24:14.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（恶性脑肿瘤）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.75,0:24:15.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莲恩医生）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.25,0:24:16.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（约翰·克莱默）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.40,0:24:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在电视里见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen you on television.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.53,0:24:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯·戈登是你的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawrence Gordon was your doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.07,0:24:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾是他的病人 他曾是我的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was his patient, and he was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.07,0:24:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,从病历上来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see from that report,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.94,0:24:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的诊断结果不是很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}my prognosis isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.51,0:24:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你同意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.51,0:24:38.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（严重压迫脑干）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.01,0:24:39.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（多形性恶性胶质瘤）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.01,0:24:41.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已转移 绝症）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.49,0:24:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你患得是不治之症\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no preventative treatment for what you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.99,0:24:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你以前也这么说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you saying that to me once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.06,0:24:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎是一个语气\N{\fnArial\fs30}in almost the exact same tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.73,0:24:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,并把我丢给了另一个医生 让他 用冷冰冰的医学术语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it to a doctor to find such a cold, clinical way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.50,0:24:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 自己正在步向死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}of saying I'm a dead man walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.70,0:25:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 你觉得我还能活多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking at me, how long would you say I have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.47,0:25:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得要检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have to examine you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.71,0:25:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过就算检查了 额叶肿瘤也是无法预测的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even then, a frontal lobe tumor is unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.68,0:25:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,生长的速度要依靠癌细胞的 分裂程度和其吞噬结果来决定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The growth depends on the rate of mitosis versus apoptosis…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.18,0:25:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 但这儿的较差的医疗设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but there's all this crude medical equipment around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.72,0:25:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你以为自己还身处医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}causing you to believe that you're still inside a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.29,0:25:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.69,0:25:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么还\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are you speaking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.26,0:25:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,用那医学术语给我放屁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that graduate school medical jargon?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.90,0:25:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.37,0:25:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.30,0:25:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你一个简单的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you a simple question.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.94,0:25:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭你的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on your experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.78,0:25:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我还能活多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how long do you think I have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.41,0:25:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是那么简单就能回答的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a simple answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.65,0:25:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据你的档案 我认为…活不长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on your file, I'd say… not long.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.23,0:25:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡是个令人惊喜聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is a surprise party.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.53,0:26:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 除非 你内心已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless, of course, you're already dead on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.54,0:26:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你是那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you're the type of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.14,0:26:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,吞食着止痛片来麻木自己的人 啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}who swallows antidepressants to hide the pain, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.11,0:26:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,背叛丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns their back on their husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.38,0:26:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neglects their child.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.55,0:26:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有着绝佳的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has every possible advantage in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.22,0:26:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不思进取\N{\fnArial\fs30}but chooses not to advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.79,0:26:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.26,0:26:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.13,0:26:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.00,0:26:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏规则很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules of the game are simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.60,0:26:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,违规的结果就是终极的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The consequences for breaking them are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.31,0:26:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将被考验 你的意志将被考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being tested. Your will is being tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.65,0:26:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将要使一个人活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your will to keep someone alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.95,0:26:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能遵守规则 接受生命给予的馈赠吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you follow the rules and grant someone the gift of life?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.79,0:26:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？ 不！把它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? No! Get it…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.82,0:27:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！这是什么！ 你要对我做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! What is this! What are you doing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.13,0:27:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿的装置与我的心率监控器相连\N{\fnArial\fs30}The device that you're wearing is linked to my heart rate monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.31,0:27:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我心跳消失 或者你走出了限定范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second that heart rate monitor flatlines or you move out of range,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.21,0:27:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,项圈就会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}an explosion will go off in that collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.18,0:27:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我的生命都将同时结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life and my life will end simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.82,0:27:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 求你别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please don't do this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.99,0:27:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个家庭 我有一个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a family. I have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.92,0:27:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我换个简单的说法告诉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you the simple version.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.83,0:27:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不惜一切代价的让他活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will keep him alive, whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.57,0:27:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许找借口 不许装糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No excuses. No equivocations.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.20,0:27:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许哭喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.11,0:27:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思 让他活到什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, keep him alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.68,0:27:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的监视器里面 我们有另外一个考验对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there, on those screens, we have another test subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.58,0:27:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.42,0:28:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将面对一系列的考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will face a series of tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.69,0:28:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要让约翰活下去直到那人完全通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to keep John alive until he makes it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.93,0:28:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他完成了所有的考验 而且约翰还有气的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he completes all of his tests and John is still breathing,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.10,0:28:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就会解下你的项圈…\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I will remove your collar…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.54,0:28:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.47,0:28:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我谜题中至关 重要的一块 戴伦医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a vital piece of my puzzle, Dr. Denlon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.08,0:28:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是我最后考验中的最重要部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}A critical part of what could be my final test.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.65,0:28:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 是时候开始我们的游戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, it's time to start our game.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.45,0:29:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.26,0:29:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.10,0:29:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anybody out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.81,0:29:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.18,0:29:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去的几年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over the past few years,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.91,0:29:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让自己成了生活中 空壳般的行尸走肉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have become a shell of your former self…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.95,0:29:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心充斥着憎恨和复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}consumed with hatred and vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.25,0:29:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,憎恨着那个喝醉酒并撞死你儿子的司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vengeance against the drunk driver who killed your only son.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.16,0:29:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,出于你的惊讶和沮丧 你憎恨着 这个杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vengeance against the killer, who to your surprise and dismay,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.59,0:29:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在草率审判后被判无罪释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}was set free after a hasty trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.90,0:29:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 今天 轮到了你来接受审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, however, it is you who will be put on trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.30,0:30:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要逃离这地方 你将面对一系列的考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}To escape from where you are, you will have to face a series of tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.34,0:30:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将在通过每个关卡 时受到煎熬般的考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will have to suffer to move forward through each of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.75,0:30:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是每次考验 你都会有一次机会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with each one, you will also have a chance…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.12,0:30:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次去原谅的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}a chance to forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.35,0:30:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你完成所有考验时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you complete the tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.72,0:30:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 你将最终和一个人面对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you you will finally come face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.26,0:30:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人应对你失去的孩子的死 负全部责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the man responsible for the loss of your child.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.26,0:30:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将是你最终的考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will be your ultimate test.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.43,0:30:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能原谅他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you forgive him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.54,0:30:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你最好抓紧点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hurry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.74,0:30:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个小时后 门就会锁住\N{\fnArial\fs30}In two hours, the doors will lock,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.07,0:30:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方就将会成为你的坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this place will become your tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.34,0:30:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你一直以来所期待的 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you've been waiting for, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.98,0:30:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让游戏开始吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.68,0:30:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.24,0:31:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的杀了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking killed my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.91,0:31:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈还不求饶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you fuckin' beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.75,0:31:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我是谁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.86,0:31:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来教教你 你着该死的混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fuckin' teach you, you motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.53,0:31:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你他妈想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you fuckin' deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.72,0:31:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.36,0:32:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.06,0:32:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.77,0:32:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.67,0:32:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你多少次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.51,0:32:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候你才能记住？\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you get it in your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.04,0:32:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想找个东西陪我睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to sleep with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.95,0:32:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 你只是…没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. You just… nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.95,0:32:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是不要…碰迪伦房间里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't… touch things in Dylan's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.72,0:32:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.64,0:33:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.92,0:33:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是爱你的 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I love you, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.29,0:33:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是妈妈看到我们这样会怎么想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think Mommy would say if she saw us like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.86,0:33:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去准备上学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go get ready for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.82,0:34:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.54,0:34:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.98,0:34:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.90,0:34:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.40,0:35:12.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（打开门 杰夫）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.11,0:36:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 约翰 我要你看着我的鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, John. I need you to look at my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.42,0:36:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.95,0:36:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,请看着我的鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at my nose, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.22,0:36:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我的手电光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow my flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.50,0:36:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼的话就告诉我 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me if you feel any pain, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.17,0:36:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.14,0:36:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.34,0:36:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从箱子里出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out of the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.88,0:36:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.45,0:36:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何医学设备的 情况下我的简短诊断\N{\fnArial\fs30}My 20-second analysis without any medical equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.99,0:36:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是脑内梗阻\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that his brain's herniating.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.56,0:37:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要去医院动手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs to go to the hospital and have an operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.00,0:37:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来给他的脑颅减压\N{\fnArial\fs30}to decompress his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.97,0:37:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.83,0:37:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 真的 过来 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, really. Come here. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.74,0:37:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come here. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.90,0:37:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我问问你 - 哦 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me ask you something. - Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.51,0:37:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我把约翰带来找你的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I bring John to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.31,0:37:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我带你这混蛋找他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or did I bring your self-centered ass to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.05,0:37:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好给我放明白点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better start fuckin' paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.92,0:37:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's going to any hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.72,0:37:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会创造奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't perform miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.26,0:37:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你在给他吃止疼片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're… You're giving him painkillers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.19,0:37:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样的肿瘤 他需要激素 比如强的松\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a tumor like this, he needs steroids, Prednisone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.50,0:37:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.60,0:37:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们可以试试肾上腺皮质脂醇 什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we could try some corticoid steroids,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 比如地赛米松\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, like Dexamethasone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.47,0:37:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么他妈的要 跟我讲我不明白的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you fuckin' tell me something that I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.90,0:37:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}you stupid cunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.51,0:37:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个地方可以找到这些药物 那就是医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only place that he can get those drugs is in a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.71,0:37:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然他会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or else he's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.82,0:38:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不是一个好听众\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not a good listener.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.85,0:38:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你错过一些 东西 他要是死了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you missed the part that if he dies…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.49,0:38:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.16,0:38:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在要求我做不可能的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're asking me to do the impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.30,0:38:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我在要求 是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you. He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.70,0:38:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他选择了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He chose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.07,0:38:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是我 - 阿曼达！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not me. - Amanda!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.17,0:38:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的医生不能做被要求做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our doctor can't do what's being asked of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.68,0:38:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你威胁她的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're threatening her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.85,0:38:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们游戏的规则很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules of our game have been made very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.75,0:38:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须得遵守规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to abide by those rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.02,0:38:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.78,0:38:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达！ 阿曼达！我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda! Amanda, I need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.05,0:39:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达！他需要氧气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, he needs oxygen!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.68,0:39:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,氧气 阿曼达！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxygen, Amanda!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.88,0:39:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把面罩盖在他脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the mask on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.92,0:39:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，我要你把他按住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now hold him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.43,0:39:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他的头靠一边 好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tip his head to the side. You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.94,0:39:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.31,0:39:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,氯羟安定！ 你有没有氯羟安定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ativan! Do you have Ativan?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.18,0:39:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.29,0:39:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退！后退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off! Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.35,0:39:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退！后退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off! Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.46,0:39:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住！约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.93,0:39:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住！约翰 你能挺过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're almost through this. Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.73,0:39:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺住！ 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me. We're almost done with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.86,0:40:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才的够了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.66,0:40:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在准备去医院了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready to go to the hospital now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.77,0:40:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要动手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs to have an operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.30,0:40:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.01,0:40:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是得在这儿做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we do it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.31,0:40:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在这里做 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We do it here. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.04,0:40:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.15,0:40:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的手术 我需要麻醉剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need anesthetic for a procedure like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.75,0:40:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻醉剂 还要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anesthetic. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.88,0:40:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算有了麻醉剂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with an anesthetic…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.48,0:40:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻醉剂！还要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anesthetic! What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.22,0:40:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,电钻\N{\fnArial\fs30}A power drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.67,0:41:50.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（直面你的恐惧）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.46,0:42:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我得天 噢 我得天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.04,0:42:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 求你了 让我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please. Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.51,0:42:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 为什么…为什么 你这样对我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Why… Why are you doing this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.24,0:42:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要…不要杀我 好吗？求你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't… Don't kill me. Okay? Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.98,0:42:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 钥匙 钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. The key. Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.62,0:43:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙 好的 快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Key. Okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.45,0:43:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.59,0:43:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.76,0:43:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我快被冻死了 我的胳膊已经没有知觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I'm so cold. I can't feel my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.14,0:43:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到你的第一个考验 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to your first test, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.51,0:43:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去三年里 你一直在诅咒那些名字…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the past three years, you've cursed the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.81,0:43:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些你觉得应该为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all those you thought were responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.88,0:43:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子的死负责的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the death of your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.38,0:43:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那些人应该遭受报应\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fantasize those accountable will pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.62,0:43:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 你会看到你面前 有个女人被铁链绑住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you will find a woman in front of you chained in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.59,0:43:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是为了不让她跑掉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will prevent her from running…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.79,0:43:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样她就不能像以前你儿子 被撞时她逃离了现场那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}much like she did on the day your son was hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.07,0:43:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的名字叫戴尼卡·斯考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Danica Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.30,0:43:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是唯一的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the only witness present.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.97,0:43:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你儿子出事现场的目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the scene of your son's untimely demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.38,0:44:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是她的自私自利和胆小怕事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not for her own self-absorption and cowardice,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.28,0:44:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她理应出庭作证 将凶手绳之以法\N{\fnArial\fs30}she could have brought your son's killer to justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.79,0:44:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这正是你仅有的 将她正法的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it is you who has a chance to bring her to justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.09,0:44:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然你也可以在她 被冻死前赐予她生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alone can grant her the gift of life before she freezes to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.60,0:44:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在后墙的水管背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind the pipes on the back wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.13,0:44:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以找到一把钥匙 它可以释放她 并\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will find the key that will free her and bring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.00,0:44:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让你进一步接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}one step closer to the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.50,0:44:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个应对你不幸的孩子负责的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}responsible for the loss of your child.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.11,0:44:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是准备留着钥匙 只救你自己呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you claim the key to save only yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.51,0:44:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.25,0:44:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是能良心发现 再多救几个人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or can you find it within you to save another?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.32,0:44:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己做决定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.35,0:45:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.05,0:45:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你什么都没做过！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do anything to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.22,0:45:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是因为你什么也没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly it. You didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.93,0:45:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的就要…死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fucking… dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.16,0:45:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.17,0:45:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,死在我的怀里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.40,0:45:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我八岁大的儿子死在了我得怀里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My eight-year-old son died in my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.90,0:46:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我犯了个、个、个错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a m-m-mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.54,0:46:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.41,0:46:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm human.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.37,0:46:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是人啊 就像你的儿子 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm human, just like your son was. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.11,0:46:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.12,0:46:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 看着我 看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, look at me. Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.06,0:46:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.79,0:46:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.99,0:46:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,太冷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.30,0:47:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 上帝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.90,0:48:28.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一颗子弹可以结束一切）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.33,0:49:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 你如果真的关心约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, if you really care about John,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.33,0:49:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就别让我这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't let me do this to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.30,0:49:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个聪明的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a smart woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.63,0:49:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你也知道怎样才是对他好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know what's right for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.97,0:49:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.14,0:50:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那样很难集中注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's hard to concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.97,0:50:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你身边有那么多可以杀我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you're surrounded by so many things you could kill me with,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.81,0:50:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像这把斧子 我知道你一直在看它\N{\fnArial\fs30}like this ax I saw you lookin' at.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.15,0:50:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.31,0:50:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,请便 它是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.12,0:50:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.09,0:50:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我砍脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd go for the neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.32,0:50:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不是脑外科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not the brain surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.59,0:50:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是砍的时候小声点 别让约翰听见我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it quietly so John doesn't hear me die.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.16,0:50:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然 他很可能会生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise he's likely to get upset,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.73,0:50:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯下他的心率监测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}rip off his heart rate monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.43,0:50:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.36,0:50:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候你只要找到 并解除传感器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you just have to find the sensor and disarm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.43,0:50:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样你就可以离门 走出三十英尺以上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can walk more than 30 feet out that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.94,0:50:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且也没有了爆炸的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the collar detonating.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.04,0:50:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你也可以试着自己卸掉项圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you could try and take the collar off yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.61,0:50:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那会有点棘手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that could be tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.98,0:50:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一点轻微的触动在错误的 位置时都会引发装置的爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The slightest knock in the wrong place could trigger it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.51,0:50:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.12,0:50:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是我造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.92,0:50:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你要的东西都全了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do you have everything you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.63,0:50:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些只能让我把他脑袋打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the instruments to cut someone open.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.90,0:51:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那些却不足以保住他的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the tools to save a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.80,0:51:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会惊奇的发现什么 才是保住性命的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be surprised what tools can save a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.65,0:51:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.75,0:51:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认识我 但…我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me, but… I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.19,0:52:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.06,0:52:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只有一把钥匙能打开装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only one key to open the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.17,0:52:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就在你死去狱友的胃内\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the stomach of your dead cellmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.88,0:52:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看四周吧 阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.11,0:52:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就知道我没有骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know that I'm not playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.55,0:52:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是生是死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.58,0:52:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.66,0:52:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.36,0:52:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.06,0:52:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分人都不知感激自己还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people are so ungrateful to be alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.50,0:52:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是你 至少不再是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not you, not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.30,0:52:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 别怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, do not be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.67,0:52:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人生的价值才刚刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life has just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.73,0:53:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他通过冷藏室了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made it through the freezer room.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.53,0:53:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾努力去救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.55,0:53:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你为我做一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are some things I need you to do for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.19,0:53:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我桌子… 中间的抽屉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my desk… in the center drawer,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.23,0:53:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个信封…\N{\fnArial\fs30}an envelope…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.23,0:53:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.23,0:53:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要给你动手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna do a procedure on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.74,0:53:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.24,0:53:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你的脑颅减压\N{\fnArial\fs30}To relieve the pressure on your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.81,0:53:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.81,0:53:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且去除头痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And help with the headaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.09,0:54:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.25,0:54:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达…你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda… you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.59,0:54:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.63,0:54:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在更坚强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stronger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.40,0:54:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.10,0:54:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选她是因为她是最好的 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose her 'cause she's the best, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.77,0:54:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我选她的原因之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one reason I chose her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.04,0:56:05.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（该让一切过去了）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.05,0:56:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.29,0:56:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.46,0:56:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我 求你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.33,0:56:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 救救我吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.00,0:56:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.84,0:56:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你救我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.71,0:56:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我啊 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.82,0:56:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.79,0:56:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.92,0:56:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了！ 求你救救我吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.49,0:57:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我能听到你 求你了 回答我吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I can hear you. Please, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.13,0:57:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.33,0:57:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.30,0:57:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.91,0:57:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我出去 求求你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.01,0:57:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,请救我一下吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.08,0:57:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.65,0:57:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.01,0:57:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别光站着啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.22,0:57:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.82,0:57:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫 当主持你的案子的法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff, when the judge presiding over your case.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.39,0:57:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给杀害你儿子的凶手定的刑 是如此的轻的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}sentenced your boy's murderer so lightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.90,0:57:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵魂根本没有得到治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}your soul never recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.96,0:57:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你拥有判他的 灵魂下地狱的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you have the power to sentence his soul straight to Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.47,0:57:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 你也可以原谅他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.74,0:57:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,解救他的钥匙就藏在你儿子的遗物中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key that will free him is hidden inside your son's possessions…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.74,0:57:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些遗物是你长久以来灵魂的寄托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possessions you have clung to for far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.21,0:57:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 如果你打开你脚下焚化炉的开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you flip the switch on the incinerator underneath you,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.92,0:58:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,大火将会点燃并…\N{\fnArial\fs30}a fire will cleanse you of this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.39,0:58:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,吞噬所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and destroy them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.09,0:58:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下那把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving only the key remaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.76,0:58:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时那把钥匙也 可以让你再进一步接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is also the key that will bring you closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.79,0:58:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个对你儿子的死负全部责任的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the man accountable for taking your child.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.43,0:58:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的时间不多了 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have much time, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.77,0:58:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始游戏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.80,0:58:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 把我弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.80,0:58:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.27,0:58:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.11,0:58:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.49,0:59:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罪犯法庭法官 看在上帝的份上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a criminal court judge, for Christ's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.49,0:59:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这么对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.16,0:59:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得我了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.83,0:59:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 可能你还记得蒂莫西·杨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe you remember Timothy Young?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.88,0:59:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是杀我儿子的那个司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the driver who killed my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.81,0:59:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只判了他六个月的监禁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave him six months!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.65,0:59:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.55,0:59:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以谈谈这案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talk about your case.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.89,0:59:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然你是想要个答复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously you want answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.22,0:59:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样子也没有办法给你答复啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't give them to you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.32,0:59:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很痛苦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.09,0:59:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给他判那么多 还是因为违章停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave more for fuckin' parking tickets!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.40,0:59:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.66,0:59:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以明白你所蒙受的巨大的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see that you're in a great deal of pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.07,1:00:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们还有很多方法可以让他加刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there are ways that we can have his sentence extended.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.37,1:00:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.67,1:00:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.97,1:00:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都让他走了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They let him go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.04,1:00:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就不要和他一样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't become what he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.38,1:00:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要变成一个杀手啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't become a killer!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.38,1:00:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了！ 我也有个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! I have a son, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.49,1:00:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.76,1:00:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.90,1:00:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对不起你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.44,1:00:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢.老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.25,1:00:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正在杀害我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing me!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.75,1:00:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样对我！ 我快要死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this to me! I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.76,1:00:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.06,1:01:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, you…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.20,1:01:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要帮帮我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.47,1:01:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the fuck up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.52,1:02:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.57,1:02:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.22,1:03:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他完成第二个考验了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made it through the second test.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.79,1:03:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那法官还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The judge is alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.16,1:03:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我预料的要快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.83,1:03:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 约翰 我要 你的头保持侧身方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, John, I need you to keep your head to the side.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.97,1:03:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且要保持不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keep still.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.07,1:03:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿的问题就是你的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's goin' on here is that your brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.00,1:03:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的大脑正挤压着头骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}is pushing against your skull.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.74,1:03:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做的就是试着帮你减压\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna try to relieve the pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.68,1:04:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过切下一片你的头骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}by cutting away a little bit of your skull.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.41,1:04:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会治疗你的头痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should help you with your headaches.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.08,1:04:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,并能彻底的提高你的肌能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and drastically improve your motor skills.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.68,1:04:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.92,1:04:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}All too well.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.53,1:04:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你可能会感到有点轻微的不适\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you're gonna feel some slight discomfort.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.53,1:04:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要给他做全麻吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna give him a general anesthetic?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.80,1:04:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的手术…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a procedure like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.40,1:04:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,病人要保持完全清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the patient needs to be fully alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.58,1:04:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.95,1:05:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 我要你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, I need you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.32,1:05:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.46,1:05:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 约翰 你将 会感觉到一点压迫感\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, John, you're gonna feel some pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.58,1:05:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,夹住这个 止血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's clamp this. Stop the bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.43,1:05:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,给那注射器吸满碗里的酒精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill that syringe with alcohol from that bowl.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.03,1:06:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.34,1:06:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 约翰 我需要你把嘴闭紧点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, John, I need you to keep your mouth closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.05,1:06:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会听到很多噪音\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna hear a lot of noise.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.94,1:07:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 你感觉如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, how you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.11,1:07:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没这么好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never better.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.15,1:07:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.72,1:07:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你会听到很多响声\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you're gonna hear a lot of ringing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.89,1:07:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你一动也不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to stay very still.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.40,1:07:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.11,1:08:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 约翰 我现在要把头骨移开\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, John, I'm gonna remove the skull.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.14,1:08:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他稳定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's stabilized.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.97,1:08:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 我要你把手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, I need you to raise your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.31,1:09:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,并交叉手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}and flex your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.88,1:09:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.59,1:09:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 把手举起来… 手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, raise your hand… hand…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.26,1:09:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 能听见我说话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.26,1:09:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.10,1:09:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.20,1:09:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.63,1:09:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.77,1:09:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.11,1:09:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.45,1:09:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么不动了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why isn't he moving?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.29,1:09:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,做点什么啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.09,1:09:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.29,1:09:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.96,1:09:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.47,1:09:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. - I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.30,1:10:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸！ 呼吸 该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe! Breathe, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.44,1:10:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.14,1:10:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.58,1:10:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.98,1:10:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.65,1:10:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.19,1:10:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把一切都交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will give everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.69,1:10:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括你身上的每一个细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every cell in your body.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.53,1:10:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that understood?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.86,1:11:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.54,1:11:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你臂上的记号… 它们意味着你以前的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The marks on your arms… they're from another life.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.31,1:11:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要将那些过去丢弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll leave that life behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.05,1:11:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦选择走下去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you go down that corridor…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.22,1:11:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没有回头路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.89,1:11:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.39,1:11:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.23,1:11:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那从这个开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then start with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.57,1:11:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.43,1:12:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.77,1:12:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.27,1:12:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要宰了你 你这混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you, you motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.77,1:12:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你 你他妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you, you motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.95,1:13:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他左腿铐起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put his left leg in the shackle.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.50,1:15:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候开始我们的游戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to start our game.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.43,1:15:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.84,1:15:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,减慢我的心跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow my heart rate.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.47,1:15:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,松弛我的肌肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax my muscles.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.15,1:15:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.45,1:15:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去记得把门带上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the door behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.85,1:17:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他听不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.85,1:17:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至就不知道你在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't even know you're there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.00,1:17:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.24,1:17:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把…枪…放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put… it… away.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.30,1:17:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.74,1:17:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it away.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.68,1:17:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们静静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.98,1:18:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.12,1:18:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这他妈的变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking freak.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.42,1:18:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为她刚才的行为道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize for her behavior.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.63,1:18:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还没搞清楚情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}She swims in my sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.06,1:18:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,到最后 她将会是一切的终点\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the end, she will be the closest.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.40,1:18:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都在做各种联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've ever come to a connection,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.40,1:18:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让别人可以明白其中的道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}to being understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.74,1:18:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她的感情依旧是她的…软肋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But her emotion is also her… weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.62,1:19:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿达姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.63,1:19:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿达姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.37,1:19:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.14,1:19:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.97,1:19:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.15,1:19:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna free you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.31,1:20:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿达姆！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.56,1:20:44.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你的机会来了）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.56,1:20:54.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你复仇的最后一步）
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.97,1:21:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你儿子的事情真的很抱歉 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry about your son, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.64,1:21:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过让我告诉你一些事情 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let me tell you something that I…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.41,1:21:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定的一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.74,1:21:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我判他什么刑 就算判500年\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sentence I gave him, not 500 years,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.78,1:21:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算死刑 没有什么 可以摸消你内心的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}not even death, nothing, will take your pain away.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.75,1:21:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且复仇不能解决任何问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And vengeance doesn't solve anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.92,1:21:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只会让痛苦更深 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only makes the pain greater, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.11,1:21:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是… 这他妈的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the… What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.78,1:21:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人啊 救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody, help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.82,1:22:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈的是什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.63,1:22:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.47,1:22:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈… 你他妈的想干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fu… What the fuck are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.57,1:22:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.97,1:22:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.31,1:22:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你听到了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are listening to this,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.04,1:22:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那意味着你长久以来 朝思暮想的 对峙\N{\fnArial\fs30}that means that the confrontation you so long dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.98,1:22:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经近在咫尺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is finally unfolding.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.65,1:22:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,做点什么！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.49,1:22:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你内心他就是那字符\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your head he is a cipher,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.32,1:22:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些改变你生活的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}a symbol of your life changing,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.59,1:22:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种死亡的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}a symbol of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.99,1:22:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在把他活生生的呈献给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I present him to you now as a simple human being.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.50,1:22:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字叫蒂莫西·杨\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Timothy Young.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.00,1:22:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他２７岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's 27 years old,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.83,1:22:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个医学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}a medical student with a mother and a father.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.50,1:22:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你一样有一个父亲和母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like you,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.41,1:22:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的命运在你儿子死的那天 也被彻底改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a man whose life also changed the day your son died.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.71,1:23:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一天他犯了一个可怕的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}That day he made a terrible mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.82,1:23:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为他没有为那错误负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believed he didn't pay for that mistake,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.76,1:23:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 你有机会让他付出代价了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now is your chance to make him pay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.16,1:23:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在捆绑蒂莫西的装置 是我个人最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The device Timothy is strapped to is my personal favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.10,1:23:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我称之为“绞架”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call it the rack.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.14,1:23:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的躯体是如此奇妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human body is a miraculous creation.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.78,1:23:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都在好奇 胳膊能扭转到什么程度吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever wonder how far the arm can twist?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.61,1:23:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个装置就要开始扭转了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This device is going to start twisting.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.62,1:23:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 他还有希望活下来 如果你肯帮忙的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a chance he might live, though, with your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.45,1:23:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.45,1:23:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的右边有个盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your right is a box.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.29,1:23:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,盒子后面就是钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the back of the box is a key.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.33,1:23:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它与猎枪的扳机相连\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tied to the trigger of a shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.13,1:23:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要扪心自问的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question you have to ask yourself is this…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.73,1:23:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的愿意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you willing…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.80,1:23:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜可怜我吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.30,1:23:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…为这个杀了你儿子的人挨颗子弹吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to take a bullet for the man who killed your son?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.91,1:23:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,俗话“以血还血 以牙还牙”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does "Do unto others as you would have them do unto you"
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.64,1:24:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿真适用吗 杰夫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}apply here, Jeff?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.51,1:24:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.36,1:24:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.17,1:25:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要救他啊 杰夫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to help him, Jeff!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.58,1:25:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck me!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.72,1:25:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,请停下！停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.85,1:25:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！请停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.34,1:25:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.77,1:25:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.71,1:25:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是站那儿的话 你就是谋杀犯的帮凶了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just standing there you're an accomplice to murder!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.15,1:25:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做杀人犯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a murderer?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.22,1:25:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每天都想杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've wanted to kill him every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.65,1:25:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.72,1:25:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,整整三年了 我都想杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For three years, I wanted to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.49,1:25:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 也许我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.06,1:25:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会失去你的家庭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll lose your family.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.59,1:25:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.76,1:25:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的老婆 你的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife, your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.09,1:26:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.93,1:26:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,操你妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.08,1:26:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.01,1:26:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.32,1:26:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺住 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.51,1:26:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺住 别放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.05,1:26:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.02,1:26:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 老天！噢 老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.88,1:26:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.70,1:27:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿这钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.48,1:27:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.68,1:27:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.23,1:27:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.29,1:27:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,停手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.66,1:27:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive him!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.17,1:27:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅他了！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive him! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.04,1:27:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.27,1:27:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.08,1:27:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不得好死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn you!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.01,1:28:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think it would be wise.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.15,1:28:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我聊聊天吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to engage me in conversation for your own sake?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.65,1:28:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈你的丈夫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you to tell me about your husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.56,1:28:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就好像形同陌路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like we're strangers now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.93,1:28:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.36,1:28:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次见他时 我们都是那么的冷漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time I saw him, we were so disconnected.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.07,1:28:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.94,1:29:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意献出世上的任何东西…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd give anything in the world…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.71,1:29:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…去见我丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to see my husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.18,1:29:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚姻总是很令我向往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matrimony's always fascinated me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.62,1:29:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,丈夫们几乎很难 看住他们的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Husbands barely able to look at their wives,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.15,1:29:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,妻子背着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}wives on their backs.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.62,1:29:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在小旅店里和自以 为不错的陌生人偷情\N{\fnArial\fs30}in motel rooms with perfect strangers,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.06,1:29:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只顾着照料孩子 而忽视了那些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}people who bear children only to neglect them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.83,1:29:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 直到生死离别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till death do us part, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.56,1:29:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想的我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you think you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.90,1:29:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我们俩的婚 姻所承受过的磨难\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my marriage has survived more suffering.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.74,1:29:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样的人永远想象不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}than someone like you could ever grasp.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.31,1:29:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,磨难？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suffering?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.91,1:29:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不知道什么是磨难呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't seen anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.68,1:29:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这样的人？ 我是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone like me? Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.45,1:29:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.92,1:29:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.95,1:29:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会原谅杀人犯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't condone murder,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.59,1:29:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我还…憎恶杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I… despise murderers.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.29,1:29:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.26,1:29:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你…让我走吧.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please… let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.87,1:30:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很好 阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fine, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.91,1:30:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.25,1:30:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 我们没事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.60,1:30:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你通过了这次考验 莲恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you make it through this, Lynn,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.26,1:30:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们总有一天会像 阿曼达那样感谢我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna thank me one day just as Amanda did.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.54,1:30:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 让我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.38,1:30:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.95,1:30:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你救的根本不只是我一人的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe my life isn't the one you were saving after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.46,1:30:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我谈谈你的女儿吧.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.29,1:30:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她还是个小运动员呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand she's quite a little athlete.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.33,1:31:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们可以谈谈你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we could talk about your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.97,1:31:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.24,1:31:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要活的如此没有生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you living with the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.81,1:31:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一个这么美好的家庭 却不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you have such a beautiful family,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.01,1:31:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,丈夫总感寂寞\N{\fnArial\fs30}a husband who is indeed alone,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.32,1:31:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,女儿需要母爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}a daughter who needs her mother,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.75,1:31:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,病人需要一个称职的\N{\fnArial\fs30}patients who need a competent physician.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.32,1:31:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,能正视他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who looks them in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.29,1:31:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,并对他们一视同仁的医生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and treats them like human beings?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.63,1:31:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他完成了第三个考验了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's completed the third test.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.76,1:31:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 莲恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, Lynn.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.23,1:31:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.07,1:31:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他现在还没有出去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but he's not all the way out yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.87,1:31:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,解开那个项圈 阿曼达 让她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undo her collar, Amanda, and let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.94,1:31:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他还没结束呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's not finished.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.68,1:31:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not all the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.34,1:31:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 莲恩比你想象中更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, Lynn is more important than you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.35,1:31:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,解开项圈 让她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlock her collar and let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.45,1:31:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said no.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.86,1:32:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 我们可是有规矩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, there are rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.53,1:32:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said no!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.86,1:32:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不配获得自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't deserve to go free.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.87,1:32:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.93,1:32:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应过屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't promise you shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.47,1:32:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 就算你拿着枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, even with that gun,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.07,1:32:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩 也才是掌握你生命的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is Lynn who holds your life in her hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.24,1:32:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.34,1:32:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让她完全控制我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give her control over me?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.68,1:32:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,门都没有！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.15,1:32:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会跟任何人说的 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't tell anyone. I promise I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.35,1:32:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你了 我有一个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I have a family.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.75,1:32:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 闭嘴！ 闭嘴 闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, shut up, shut up, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.52,1:32:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的不要乱动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stop fuckin' moving around!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.66,1:32:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们另外留下活口的 测试对象怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about the other test subjects that we left alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.19,1:32:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game over.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.13,1:32:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的一定要杀了你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fucking kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.96,1:32:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about them?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.46,1:32:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这样对他们的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that how you felt about them?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.54,1:32:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这样对 埃里克·马修斯的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that how you felt about Eric Matthews?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.07,1:32:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克·马修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric Matthews.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.21,1:32:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.47,1:32:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我告诉你我是怎么 对埃里克·马修斯的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you how I felt about Eric Matthews.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.84,1:33:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.18,1:33:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.08,1:33:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.09,1:33:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.83,1:34:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.59,1:35:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my son?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.43,1:35:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪 你这该死的婊子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he, you junkie bitch?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.81,1:35:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.99,1:35:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.99,1:35:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我她在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.76,1:35:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就他妈的在这儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right fuckin' here.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.18,1:36:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这婊子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.42,1:36:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的什么都不是 婊子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothin', bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.72,1:36:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你算什么东西！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.16,1:36:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是“竖锯”\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Jigsaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.97,1:36:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是“竖锯” 婊子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Jigsaw, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.21,1:36:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.98,1:36:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你算个屁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.09,1:37:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是“竖锯” 婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Jigsaw, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.76,1:37:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothin'!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.93,1:37:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的一定要杀了你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fuckin' kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.80,1:37:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.14,1:37:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.67,1:37:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.07,1:37:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他夺走了我的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took my life from me,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.71,1:37:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我只是在帮他个小忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I just returned the fuckin' favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.04,1:37:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 阿曼达 那只是你的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Amanda, that's what you thought,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.05,1:37:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不那么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know different.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.62,1:37:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让他死 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left him for dead, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.22,1:37:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别和我胡扯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop fucking with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.72,1:37:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我清除了你的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I cleaned up your mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.06,1:37:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你原谅他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgave you for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.40,1:37:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我走！求你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go! Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.30,1:37:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的所作所为和杀人犯有啥区别？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you do is no different than murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.40,1:37:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你折磨他们！ 眼睁睁的看他们死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You torture people. You watch them die.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.34,1:37:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在却在求我 放了这个没用婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now you're begging me not to kill this worthless bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.41,1:37:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就凭游戏规则这个理由？\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the grounds of some game?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.24,1:37:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在把我们都推向 悬崖边 阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are walking us toward a precipice, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.58,1:37:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step back.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.25,1:37:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,放屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.65,1:38:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody changes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.25,1:38:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all a lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.32,1:38:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你失败了 我们就都输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you fail in this, we all fail.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.32,1:38:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功了 那就皆大欢喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Succeed, and we all succeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.59,1:38:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.60,1:38:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 她没有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you, she hasn't changed,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.63,1:38:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为没有人他妈的改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}because nobody fuckin' changes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.10,1:38:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人脱胎换骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody is reborn.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.44,1:38:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那全都是放屁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.67,1:38:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是他妈的胡扯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all a fuckin' lie!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.77,1:38:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是你愚蠢游戏里的一个小卒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm just a pawn in your stupid games.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.62,1:38:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你来说什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean anything to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.73,1:38:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你是我的一切！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you mean everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.46,1:38:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.30,1:38:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的命运紧连\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fates are linked.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.53,1:38:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都在尝试着帮你 阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried to help you, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.74,1:38:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 帮我啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.70,1:38:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,改造我啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fix me!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.91,1:39:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,改造我啊 你这混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fix me, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.24,1:39:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就站在这儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm standin' right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.22,1:39:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么对你这么重要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is she so important to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.02,1:39:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对我来说并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not important to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.92,1:39:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对你却很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's important to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.56,1:39:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对我不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not important to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.89,1:39:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你再考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you to reconsider that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.39,1:39:29.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（最后的机会）
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.34,1:39:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是你最后的机会了 阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your last chance, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.31,1:39:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她算个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.46,1:39:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your time's running out.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.06,1:39:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你再想想你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you think about what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.70,1:40:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想你做过的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about everything that you've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.55,1:40:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想你答应过我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think about what you promised me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.45,1:40:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想我们的梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.22,1:40:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.86,1:40:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lynn?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.42,1:40:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫！杰夫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff! Jeff…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.19,1:40:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lynn.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.90,1:40:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lynn.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.97,1:40:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莲恩 - 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lynn. - Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.00,1:40:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚毁掉了你的生命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just destroyed four lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.94,1:40:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚杀了杰夫的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just murdered Jeff's wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.63,1:40:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.39,1:41:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.50,1:41:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.61,1:41:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的考验…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your test…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.31,1:41:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your game.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.11,1:41:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I want?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.58,1:41:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.88,1:41:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将被考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being tested.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.12,1:41:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意志将被考验…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your will is being tested…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.35,1:41:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将要使一个人活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your will to keep someone alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.36,1:41:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.42,1:41:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能遵守规则 将生命作为礼物赐予某人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you follow the rules and grant someone the gift of life?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.63,1:41:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在考验你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was testing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.40,1:41:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took you in.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.37,1:41:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就要把一切都交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will give everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.47,1:41:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.57,1:41:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括身体的每一个细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every cell in your body.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.74,1:41:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择了你并以让你 继承我一生的工作为荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I selected you for the honor of carrying on my life's work.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.84,1:41:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.81,1:41:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.75,1:41:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.85,1:41:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我憎恶杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I despise murderers.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.15,1:41:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本没有在考验人们求生的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't test anyone's will to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.49,1:41:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game over.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.15,1:42:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,相反你夺走了他们唯一的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead you took away their only chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.82,1:42:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的游戏根本没有赢家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your games were unwinnable.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.56,1:42:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的考验对象只是你的牺牲品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your subjects merely victims.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.40,1:42:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.90,1:42:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那没有回头路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.13,1:42:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.23,1:42:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝望之下 我决定给你最后一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my desperation, I decided to give you one last chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.77,1:42:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我将一切就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I put everything in place.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.94,1:42:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选她是因为她是最好的 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose her 'cause she's the best, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.78,1:42:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我选她的原因之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one reason I chose her.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.68,1:42:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不知道莲恩和杰夫是夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know that Lynn and Jeff were husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.85,1:42:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了达到游戏的目的 我没有告诉你这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to keep that from you for the purposes of my game.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.16,1:42:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不省略 他们破碎的婚姻生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to leave out the ruined marriage,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.46,1:42:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷情的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cheating wife,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.73,1:42:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,满心复仇的丈夫 孤独的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}the vengeful husband, the neglected daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.57,1:42:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且我让你自己做了选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I let you make your own choices.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.57,1:42:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.88,1:42:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, put it away.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.01,1:43:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 就算你拿着枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, even with that gun,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.35,1:43:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩才是掌握你生命的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's Lynn who holds your life in her hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.12,1:43:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对我不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not important to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.79,1:43:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你再考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you to reconsider that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.42,1:43:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,解开项圈 让她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlock her collar and let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.36,1:43:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said no!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.79,1:43:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们游戏的规则很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules of our game have been made very clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.03,1:43:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你必须得遵守规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to abide by those rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.40,1:43:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.71,1:43:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.39,1:43:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game over.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.07,1:44:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚什么都没学到 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't learned anything tonight, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.24,1:44:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的愤怒和仇恨 只能伤害到你所爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your rage and your vengeance will only hurt the ones you love.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.55,1:44:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我只能让你更加痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing me will only add to your misery.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.92,1:44:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样是换不回你的儿子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will not bring back your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.69,1:44:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想你的女儿吧 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of your daughter, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.75,1:44:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在比任何时候都更需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs you now more than ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.86,1:44:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能杀我的 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill me, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.50,1:44:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子快死了 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife's dying, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.67,1:44:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her time's running out.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.12,1:44:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫 不要弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff, do not miscalculate.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.95,1:44:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的命运在我手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fate is in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.72,1:44:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子的命运在我手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife's fate is in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.63,1:44:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.96,1:44:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.47,1:45:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你回家 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking you home. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.14,1:45:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使 你可能没看到威胁…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though you may not see any threat…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.81,1:45:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但威胁无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are threats all around you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.17,1:45:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫 你如果要试着移动你的妻子 她就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff, if you try to move your wife, she will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.14,1:45:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以在四分钟内叫来一辆救护车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can have an ambulance here in four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.01,1:45:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望今晚把妻子带走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to take your wife out of here tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.82,1:45:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望带她去个安全的地方吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to take her to safety?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.42,1:45:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.65,1:45:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这儿面对我 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand and face me, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.29,1:45:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留下来陪我 求你 - 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay with me, please. - Right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.59,1:45:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,想找回你以前的生活吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to get your life back?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.03,1:45:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吗 杰夫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you, Jeff?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.03,1:45:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以令你实现梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.13,1:45:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,选哪个呢 杰夫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is it, Jeff?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.24,1:45:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧…是或不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on… yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.54,1:45:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.74,1:45:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.11,1:45:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一个考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}One final test.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.81,1:45:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules are simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.75,1:45:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那张桌子上有很多邪恶的工具…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over on that table, there's a host of vicious implements…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.32,1:45:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个都可以激发你庞 大的肉躯下内心的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}which you can use to exact your pound of flesh,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.99,1:45:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你用来复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take your vengeance,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.42,1:45:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你放纵自己杀戮的妄想\N{\fnArial\fs30}to indulge your obsession.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.76,1:46:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是你放弃仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can choose to put your vengeance aside,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.03,1:46:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择宽恕与原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can forgive.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.77,1:46:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以原谅我带给你的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can forgive me for the pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.27,1:46:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及我给你和你的妻子带来的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I've caused you and your wife tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.44,1:46:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.61,1:46:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,何去何从 杰夫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is it gonna be, Jeff?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.68,1:46:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.79,1:46:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.79,1:46:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.46,1:46:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.63,1:46:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是生是死 杰夫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live or die, Jeff?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.80,1:46:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make our choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.18,1:46:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.19,1:47:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.66,1:47:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫 杰夫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff. Jeff!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.27,1:47:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫 不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.65,1:47:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.10,1:47:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.97,1:47:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我录制了这盘带子 以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made this tape as an insurance policy, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.54,1:47:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.58,1:48:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你现在在听这个的话 那就表示是时候收尾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you're listening to it, then it's time to collect.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.58,1:48:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你宽恕之心的最终考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was your final test of forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.79,1:48:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你听到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you are listening to this,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.59,1:48:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那说明你失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.86,1:48:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你必须要付出代价…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you must pay the price…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.23,1:48:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为复仇而活所付的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}the price for living for nothing but vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.90,1:48:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要给你一些活下去的启示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I will give you something to live for.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.17,1:48:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉了你 你不能杀我的 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you that you couldn't kill me, Jeff,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.00,1:48:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没说过为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't tell you why,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.47,1:48:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the answer is simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.74,1:48:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是那个应对你损失的孩子负责的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the person responsible for the loss of your child.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.68,1:48:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是唯一知道你女儿下落的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the only person who knows where your daughter is.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.19,1:48:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她待的地方的空气 可没那么多 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She only has a limited supply of air, Jeff,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.26,1:48:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 如果你想找回她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you want to get her back,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.62,1:48:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就必须玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll have to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.70,1:48:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff!
